[Music]  the first look at marvel's werewolf by  night has come out of the shadows here's  why this special presentation has more  going on than you might think  one of the biggest surprises to come out  of marvel studios panel at 2022's d23  event was the release of the werewolf by  night trailer kevin feige revealed this  is the first ever holiday special for  marvel studios and the trailer even  debuted a new intro card we've never  seen before instead of the traditional  marvel studios logo we're used to a  colorful netflix-esque graphic  introduced a special presentation card  with the studio logo above it the  werewolf by night trailer is like  nothing we've ever seen in the marvel  cinematic universe before it's a campy  throwback to the hammer horror films of  old shot entirely in black and white and  creepy as all get out the popcorn flick  will be the mcu's first halloween  special introducing gail garcia bernal's  jack russell aka werewolf by night into  the cinematic universe we met some  classic comic book characters in the  trailer while also being introduced to  brand new players all in this terrifying  gathering of monster hunters there's a  lot to be distracted by in the unusual  trailer so we broke down some of the  small details you might have missed  tonight  it is every hunter for  themselves  a character we weren't quite sure we'd  ever get in the mcu is finally here man  thing who made his marvel studios debut  in the werewolf finite trailer in a  blink and you'll miss it moment dr ted  salas first appeared in 1971's savage  tales number one and is one of marvel  comics most unusual characters dr salus  becomes man thing after injecting  himself with his so2 serum a failed  super soldier serum replica and crashing  his car into a part of the florida  everglades that just happens to be the  nexus of all realities you can clearly  see man thing at the 105 mark in the  trailer where he looks to be melting a  combatant manthing does have connections  to werewolf in the comics as both were  members of the legion of monsters  whether that group forms in the holiday  special remains to be seen but the team  also includes elsa bloodstone who is  featured in the werewolf by night  trailer heavily at least we think it  hasn't been officially confirmed at this  point but it's almost a 99 certainty  that outlander star laura donnelly is  playing elsa bloodstone in werewolf by  night the daughter of ulysses bloodstone  elsa is a master monster hunter who  often favors firearms as her weapons of  choice despite that history the woman we  see in the trailer seems much more timid  than the elsa fans of the comics know  and love donnelly's character seems to  cower around jack russell when he's  transforming into the werewolf in front  of her in the cage this could be just a  put on or maybe it's a part of the  character's development on screen either  way here's hoping we'll see elsa turn  into the badass she's known to be in the  marvel's comic pages the film's black  and white appearance makes elsa's hair  look like it's a dark brown or black but  it's definitely possible she's sporting  her comic variants bright red locks  somewhere beneath the special shades of  grey some characters don't quite fit in  with the theme of werewolf by night  sticking out like sore thumbs outside of  the creepy and spooky monster hunters we  see gathering at varus's behest there  are uniformed outsiders who appear to be  crashing the party those uniforms look  awfully familiar they sort of look like  time variants authority agents as seen  in loki season 1 however it's worth  noting that the uniforms are not a 100  match so this could be another one of  those classic misdirections from our  friends at marvel these agents were  tasked with capturing variants and those  who disrupt the sacred timeline it's  suspected that werewolf by night takes  place in the past and we think they  might be crashing the monster mesh in  search of the darkhold that is if that  really is the tva there is precedent for  that from the comics the sacred text  first makes an appearance in marvel  spotlight volume one number four which  centered around a werewolf by night  story jack russell finds the dark hold  which we know is extremely dangerous in  the mcu thanks in no small part to the  scarlet witch it makes sense the tva  would intervene anywhere that darkhold  might be present as wanda recently  demonstrated bad actors in pursuit of  the book can connect to alternate selves  in other timelines making them a major  threat for the tva  [Music]

